### Apply WFH
POST http://localhost:8000/api/wfh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee": {
    "employeeId": 7
  },
  "requestDate": "2026-11-25",
  "reason": "Internet issue at office location"
}

###

### Get All WFH Requests
GET http://localhost:8000/api/wfh

###

### Get Employee WFH Requests
GET http://localhost:8000/api/wfh/employee/7

###

### Approve WFH
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/wfh/1/approve?approvedBy=Manager

###

### Reject WFH
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/wfh/1/reject

